SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5

RATES
Calcite_rate
-start
10 k = 10
20 sa = 1.0
30 rate = k*sa
40 moles = rate*TIME
50 SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite_rate
        -formula Calcite 1
        -m 1
        -m0 1
        -steps 10 in 100 steps

END